    skos:prefLabel "49 After subparagraph 23XWQ(2)(b)(i)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-49 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (ia) in a case where the informed consent of the parent or guardian of the volunteer is given in accordance with section 23XWR—after the constable concerned has informed the child or incapable person that, even though consent has been given, if he or she objects to or resists the carrying out of the forensic procedure it will not be carried out; and" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (ia) in a case where the informed consent of the parent or guardian of the volunteer is given in accordance with section 23XWR—after the constable concerned has informed the child or incapable person that, even though consent has been given, if he or she objects to or resists the carrying out of the forensic procedure it will not be carried out; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "84cd5f5974c591613d678e677f5a78bae1d1fcc3ce9ec9d45efa72f923a6d7eb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Informed consent of parent or guardian required for forensic procedure" ;
