concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-1-sec-65 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65 Subsection 23YG(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-65 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) Subject to subsection (3), material of any kind that is required by this Part to be made available to a suspect, offender or volunteer must be made available in accordance with subsection (1): (a) within 14 days after the material comes into existence; or  Forensic procedures  Schedule 1 Amendments commencing on day after Royal Assent  Part 1 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012 (b) if the material is requested by the suspect, offender or volunteer or the suspect’s, offender’s or volunteer’s interview friend or legal representative, within 14 days of the request. (3) Subsection (2) does not apply to: (a) copies of records required to be made available under subsection 23XE(5); and (b) material required to be provided under section 23XU; and (c) copies of results of analysis and other information required to be provided under section 23XW." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) Subject to subsection (3), material of any kind that is required by this Part to be made available to a suspect, offender or volunteer must be made available in accordance with subsection (1): (a) within 14 days after the material comes into existence; or  Forensic procedures  Schedule 1 Amendments commencing on day after Royal Assent  Part 1 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012 (b) if the material is requested by the suspect, offender or volunteer or the suspect’s, offender’s or volunteer’s interview friend or legal representative, within 14 days of the request. (3) Subsection (2) does not apply to: (a) copies of records required to be made available under subsection 23XE(5); and (b) material required to be provided under section 23XU; and (c) copies of results of analysis and other information required to be provided under section 23XW."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fc61fc4a50e655d12b70c909f99174b3a8932dca19bfcf9d8128e3cad72db45b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-1-sec-65-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-1-sec-65-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
