concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-1-sec-74 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "74 Saving—orders by senior constable"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-74 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by item 16 does not affect the validity of an order that is in force under section 23WN of the Crimes Act 1914 immediately before the commencement of that item." ;
