    cof:title "29 Application of this Part" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by this Part apply to any ACC information, whether the information comes into the possession of the ACC before or after this item commences.  Amendments relating to returnable items for the ACC  Schedule 3  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012" ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

