concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-3-sec-24aa-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-3-sec-24aa-ss-2-logic-deontic-4 .
