concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-3-sec-24aa-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24AA(7) Use of and sharing returnable items"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-24aa-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) To avoid doubt, this section does not limit any other law of the Commonwealth that: (a) requires or authorises the use of a document or other thing; or  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to returnable items for the ACC  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012 (b) requires or authorises the making available (however described) of a document or other thing. Sharing returnable item for use by State, Territory or foreign agency" ;
    skos:definition "(7) To avoid doubt, this section does not limit any other law of the Commonwealth that: (a) requires or authorises the use of a document or other thing; or  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to returnable items for the ACC  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012 (b) requires or authorises the making available (however described) of a document or other thing. Sharing returnable item for use by State, Territory or foreign agency"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eedf151b53a469460d28989b0ebb73ae1a73aac7b193b4deedd0572fc7346b5e" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-3-sec-24aa ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Requires use of documents or other things for certain laws" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
