concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-3-sec-24aa-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24AA(3) Use of and sharing returnable items"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-24aa-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, if the returnable item is a document, the CEO is required to take reasonable steps to return the document only if the ACC took possession of that document." ;
    skos:definition "(3) To avoid doubt, if the returnable item is a document, the CEO is required to take reasonable steps to return the document only if the ACC took possession of that document."@en ;
