concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-3-sec-24ac-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24AC(8) Issuing officer may permit a returnable item to be retained,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-24ac-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) An issuing officer performing a function of, or connected with, making an order under this section has the same protection and immunity as if he or she were performing that function as, or as a member of, a court (being the court of which the issuing officer is a member)." ;
    skos:definition "(8) An issuing officer performing a function of, or connected with, making an order under this section has the same protection and immunity as if he or she were performing that function as, or as a member of, a court (being the court of which the issuing officer is a member)."@en ;
