doc:sch-4-sec-75-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "75(3) Notice to give information or to produce document or thing" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The notice must: (a) be served on the person; and (b) be signed by the Integrity Commissioner; and (c) specify the period within which, and the manner in which, the person must comply with the notice." ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-75-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "75(4) Notice to give information or to produce document or thing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-75-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The period specified under paragraph (3)(c) must be at least 14 days after the day the notice is served on the person, unless the Integrity Commissioner considers that allowing a 14-day period  Schedule 4  Amendments relating to the Integrity Commissioner’s investigative powers  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012 would significantly prejudice a corruption investigation, in which case a shorter period may be specified." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The period specified under paragraph (3)(c) must be at least 14 days after the day the notice is served on the person, unless the Integrity Commissioner considers that allowing a 14-day period  Schedule 4  Amendments relating to the Integrity Commissioner’s investigative powers  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012 would significantly prejudice a corruption investigation, in which case a shorter period may be specified."@en ;
