concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-75-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "75(5) Notice to give information or to produce document or thing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-75-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If a shorter period is specified under paragraph (3)(c), the Integrity Commissioner must record, in writing: (a) the name of the corruption investigation that would be prejudiced; and (b) why a 14-day period would significantly prejudice the investigation." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If a shorter period is specified under paragraph (3)(c), the Integrity Commissioner must record, in writing: (a) the name of the corruption investigation that would be prejudiced; and (b) why a 14-day period would significantly prejudice the investigation."@en ;
