    values:originalText "(1) A person served with a notice under section 75 must comply with the notice: (a) within the period specified in the notice; or (b) within such further time as the Integrity Commissioner allows under subsection (3). Note 1: Failure to comply with a notice is an offence: see section 78. Note 2: See also subsection 150(2) in relation to section 149 certified information. Extension of time" ;
