concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-77a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77A(6) Disclosure of notice may be prohibited"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-77a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If a notation is included in the notice, it must be accompanied by a written statement setting out the rights and obligations conferred or imposed by section 77B on the person on whom the notice is served. Cancellation of notation" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If a notation is included in the notice, it must be accompanied by a written statement setting out the rights and obligations conferred or imposed by section 77B on the person on whom the notice is served. Cancellation of notation"@en ;
