concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-77a-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77A(7) Disclosure of notice may be prohibited"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-77a-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) A notation included in the notice is cancelled by this subsection if: (a) the Integrity Commissioner concludes the investigation to which the notice relates; and (b) any criminal proceedings or civil penalty proceedings resulting from the investigation are commenced." ;
    skos:definition "(7) A notation included in the notice is cancelled by this subsection if: (a) the Integrity Commissioner concludes the investigation to which the notice relates; and (b) any criminal proceedings or civil penalty proceedings resulting from the investigation are commenced."@en ;
