doc:sch-4-sec-77a-ss-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "77A(8) Disclosure of notice may be prohibited" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(8) If a notation is cancelled by subsection (7), the Integrity Commissioner must advise the person who was served with the notated notice, in writing, of the cancellation.  Amendments relating to the Integrity Commissioner’s investigative powers  Schedule 4  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012 Relationship of notation with the Privacy Act 1988" ;
    cof:pageNumber "45"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-77a-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77A(9) Disclosure of notice may be prohibited"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-77a-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) If: (a) a notation has been included in the notice in relation to the disclosure of information about the notice or any official matter connected with the notice; and (b) the notation has not been cancelled; and (c) apart from this subsection, a credit reporting agency (within the meaning of section 11A of the Privacy Act 1988) would be required, under subsection 18K(5) of that Act, to make a note about the disclosure of the information; such a note must not be made until the notation is cancelled." ;
    skos:definition "(9) If: (a) a notation has been included in the notice in relation to the disclosure of information about the notice or any official matter connected with the notice; and (b) the notation has not been cancelled; and (c) apart from this subsection, a credit reporting agency (within the meaning of section 11A of the Privacy Act 1988) would be required, under subsection 18K(5) of that Act, to make a note about the disclosure of the information; such a note must not be made until the notation is cancelled."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9f6930a18b27eec220c7dccf0e3bd75466e10e644104e535e230a1bfcdc7beff" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-77a ;
    cof:pageNumber "45"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibition on making a note about disclosure of information until notation is cancelled." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012.pdf> ;
