    skos:prefLabel "23 Paragraph 83(1)(b)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (b) to produce documents or things specified in the summons; if the Integrity Commissioner has reasonable grounds to suspect that the evidence, documents or things will be relevant to the investigation of a corruption issue or the conduct of a public inquiry." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (b) to produce documents or things specified in the summons; if the Integrity Commissioner has reasonable grounds to suspect that the evidence, documents or things will be relevant to the investigation of a corruption issue or the conduct of a public inquiry."@en ;
