concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-96b-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96B(5) Federal Court or Supreme Court to deal with contempt"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-96b-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) To avoid doubt, if the Integrity Commissioner makes an application under this section, the Integrity Commissioner need not give the evidence to the relevant person or authority under section 142. How court may deal with application" ;
    skos:definition "(5) To avoid doubt, if the Integrity Commissioner makes an application under this section, the Integrity Commissioner need not give the evidence to the relevant person or authority under section 142. How court may deal with application"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2d88e9f398f4c28508a2b1c66a809c3508d76eb56a050f82c81aad205f508a39" ;
