concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-7-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Paragraph 19AN(1)(b)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "Omit “if, under subsection 19AL(4), the day on which a supervision period ends is fixed in the parole order”, substitute “if the parole order specifies in accordance with subsection 19AL(3) that the person is to be released subject to supervision”.  Schedule 7  Releasing federal offenders from prison  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012" ;
    skos:definition "Omit “if, under subsection 19AL(4), the day on which a supervision period ends is fixed in the parole order”, substitute “if the parole order specifies in accordance with subsection 19AL(3) that the person is to be released subject to supervision”.  Schedule 7  Releasing federal offenders from prison  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers and Offences) Act 2012 Compilation date: 05/04/2012"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fa4619dff6f8c4c853da50ddf5538abd3d30a356ae3f4e4077f58e6e9c8670e2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Omit specific phrase from parole order" ;
