concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-7-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Paragraph 19AP(6)(b)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (b) specify whether or not the person is to be released subject to supervision; and (c) if it is proposed that the supervision period for a person released on licence subject to supervision should end before the end of the person’s licence period—specify the day on which the supervision period ends." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (b) specify whether or not the person is to be released subject to supervision; and (c) if it is proposed that the supervision period for a person released on licence subject to supervision should end before the end of the person’s licence period—specify the day on which the supervision period ends."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "823bb5f711426f822a39d0d9fdab093dc7b1d28b0cb6b34289e433217ffa05cf" ;
